# a_locutions.voc — Words after 'a' that make it a preposition in a fixed locution
# ('a mais', 'a gosto', 'a vapor'), not the article that opens a direct object.
# Cooking infinitives are listed one by one ('molho a ferver'): a general 'a' +
# infinitive test would misread objects ending in -er ('molho a colher', 'a mulher').
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

apurar
aquecer
arrefecer
borbulhar
cozinhar
engrossar
ferver
frio
fundo
gosto
granel
mais
menos
olho
pressa
quente
reduzir
rigor
seguir
vapor
